{
  "id": "VA-HB-1144-2018",
  "scope": "state:va",
  "title": "HB 1144 (2018 Regular Session (LIS session code 181)): Voter registration; persons assisting with the return of signed voter registration applications.",
  "urls": [
    "https://legacylis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?181+sum+HB1144",
    "https://legacylis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?181+mbr+HB1144",
    "https://legacylis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?181+ful+HB1144ER",
    "https://legacylis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?181+ful+HB1144 (introduced; not read)",
    "https://legacylis.virginia.gov/cgi-bin/legp604.exe?181+ful+HB1144H1 (Governor substitute; not read)"
  ],
  "version": "enrolled",
  "operative_text": "(a_in_person_id) not stated.\n(b_no_id_remedy) not stated.\n(c_mail_ballot_id) not stated.\n(d_proof_of_citizenship) not stated.\n(e_other_rule)\n(section) § 24.2-418.2 (new section; as passed (enrolled; struck words removed, new words kept))\n(quote) Any person who assists an applicant with the completion of a voter registration application or collects a completed voter registration application directly from an applicant shall provide his name and telephone number and indicate the group or organization with which he is affiliated, if any, on the registration application. This section shall not apply to any state or local government employee who assists with the completion of registration applications or collects completed registration applications as part of his official duties set forth in this chapter.\n(note) Off this topic: the bill requires identifying information from people who help with or collect voter registration applications; it sets no voter-ID or citizenship-document rule.\n(other) Only new § 24.2-418.2 is added; no other subject.\n(note) Off this topic: the bill sets no ID or citizenship-proof rule.",
  "sponsors": [
    {
      "name": "Tony O. Wilt",
      "role": "author",
      "version": "Enrolled (HB1144ER, 3/7/2018); passed both chambers; Governor substitute ruled not germane 4/18/2018; vetoed 5/18/2018"
    }
  ],
  "single_subject": [],
